title After a goal
intro Red has the ball in front of your goal.

setup
  lineup 7v7
  player R-LF at 31, 47
  ball with R-LF

step
  caption Red has the ball and shoots…

step
  caption It’s in! Red scored a goal.
  ball to -1.2, 36
  arrow from R-LF to ball
  draw goal-mouth left
  duration 1450

question
  prompt Who gets the ball?
  answer Blue
  wrong Red
  wrong Nobody
  wrong Play on
  correct Blue's ball.
  why After a goal, the team that got scored on gets the ball.

question
  prompt What restart is it?
  answer Kick-off
  wrong Throw-in
  wrong Goal kick
  wrong Corner
  correct Kick-off.
  why Play starts again with a kick-off from the center circle.
